Description: Wireless CarPlay receiver for Taurine on iOS 14.
 Showcase turns a jailbroken iPhone or iPad into a wireless CarPlay
 receiver. This package is for Taurine on iOS 14 only. Other jailbreaks
 use the regular Showcase package.
 .
 It starts BTstack before Apple's Bluetooth stops, waits longer for the
 controller, uses the newer BTstack daemon and adds BTQuiet, which slows
 Bluetooth clients' reconnects while Showcase owns the controller.
